MDL313, F4: GKeyFile returns values raw, so outputdir="dump" keeps its
quotes: mydumper silently writes the dump into a directory literally named
"dump" (quotes included), not dump. Compare
mdl313-quoted-absolute-outputdir-aborts.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/mydumper.cnf --host mysql --user e2e --password e2e-password --database app
lint: MDL313
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect connected: true
expect dump-dir: "dump"
-- mydumper.cnf --
[mydumper]
outputdir="dump"
